2.19.m:
That weapon, resembling the flames of the fire of cosmic dissolution, ascended upwards;
and Śaṅkhacūḍa fell to the ground like a staff in devotion.
She carefully hurled the Brahmā weapon, accompanied by mantras; // 52

The glorious lord of the Dānavas, master of all perfections, expanded his form;
and that excellent master of all perfections warded her off.
Enraged and fearsome, Kālī, with the swift blow of her fist, // 62
